# `analytics.list_sessions`

List agent sessions with rollup metrics (tokens, cost, tool use).

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.analytics.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `limit` | `number` |

## Returns

`AnalyticsSessionsResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `sessions` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call analytics.list_sessions --json '{ "limit": 0 }'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "sessions": [
    {
      "session_key": "sess-rust-lane-1",
      "actor_id": "actor-rust-lane-harbor",
      "harness": "claude",
